(property "Description" "Functional interface with logical connector names; no implied physical PCB pin numbering. | module | Ports ANT, RF and DC are functional names. Confirm labels, DC connector polarity and the receiver-side DC block on the actual supplied unit.; v2.1: the DC port is BONI13V8_PORT, behind the E2 blocking element Q2903; with EN_BONI low it is isolated from BONI13V8. It now sees the Boni ILIM (≤0.154 A with RILM 7.15k) and any foreign DC on HF_CM: E4-03 requires a DC current rating ≥0.16 A and DC-block/choke voltage ratings ≥30 V." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
