(text "E4-03 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.3; §8.1 HF-9, HF-11" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 159.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 02e1e394-c6db-5641-bb12-573f99dfc6f4))
(text "Boni supplied bias-tee port labels, DC socket polarity and receiver DC block require actual hardware.\nВорота (стенд): Measure continuity/polarity, antenna DC and RADIO port <0.1 V before connecting HF+. v2.1:\nA406 DC is BONI13V8_PORT behind the E2 blocking element Q2903 — confirm on the supplied Einspeiseweiche a DC\ncurrent rating ≥0.16 A (ILIM max 0.153 A, 0.154 A with TCR, RILM 7.15k) and DC-block/choke voltage ratings ≥30\nV; otherwise use the homemade 2.2 mH bias-tee with a choke Irms and Isat ≥0.20 A and count its DCR in the 12.0\nV barrel gate." (at 13.97 161.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid e8f28577-6728-502a-b4b1-16de98fcbf28))
